OL,3,GNEWSAAmber wind warning in place as
OL,4,Astorm hits
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn amber warning for wind has been
OL,7,Fissued for parts of Cumbria and the
OL,8,Fnorth-east of England as the region
OL,9,Fbraces itself for Storm Boelo.
OL,11,FHigh winds are expected to batter north
OL,12,Fand west Cumbria, including Carlisle,
OL,13,FWhitehaven and Alston, also hitting
OL,14,FNorthumberland and County Durham, with
OL,15,FAllendale, Barnard Castle and Stanhope
OL,16,Fcovered by the warning.
OL,18,FThe Met Office warning, in place for 24
OL,19,Fhours from 21:00 BST on Saturday, means
OL,20,Fthere is a chance of power cuts, damage
OL,21,Fto buildings and trees, disruption to
OL,22,Frail, air and ferry services.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,396,390,260,160,0,100
