OL,3,GNEWSAAmber wind warning in place as
OL,4,Astorm hits
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome rail services have been cancelled
OL,7,Fand a number of visitor attractions
OL,8,Fhave said they would not be opening on
OL,9,FSunday due to the high winds forecast.
